  "instructions": [
    {
      "primary_message": "This recipe utilizes 4 medium food storage containers.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Place eggs in a medium saucepan, cover with hot water (from the tap) and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to a simmer and cook for 8 minutes. Drain and add ice or run under cold water to cool; set aside.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "While the eggs are cooking, fill a large pot halfway with hot water (from the tap). Add salt, cover, and bring to a boil over high heat. Once boiling, uncover, add pasta, and stir for a few seconds; cook until desired firmness, 8-10 minutes. Drain pasta and rinse under cold water to cool completely; set aside.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": "1 tsp salt\n10 oz rotini pasta"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Meanwhile, wash and dry the fresh produce.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": "2 stick celery\n1 English cucumber\n1 small bunch Italian (flat-leaf) parsley"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Trim and small dice celery. Place in a large bowl.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Trim and medium dice cucumber. Add to the bowl with the celery.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Trim, seed, and small dice bell peppers. Add to the bowl.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Shave parsley leaves off the stems; discard stems and mince the leaves. Add to the bowl.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Peel and mince shallot. Add to the bowl.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": "1 shallot"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Once the eggs have cooled, peel and halve lengthwise. Using a spoon, separate the yolks from the whites and place the yolks in a small bowl. Roughly chop the egg whites, add to the bowl with the veggies, and set aside.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Gently mash the yolks with a fork. Add mayo, Dijon, vinegar, and spices to the bowl; stir to combine the dressing.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": "⅔ cup mayonnaise\n2 tbsp Dijon mustard\n2 tbsp apple cider vinegar\n1 tsp salt\n½ tsp paprika\n¼ tsp black pepper"
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Add cooled pasta and dressing to the bowl with the veggies, then stir to combine the pasta salad. Divide between containers.\n\n",
      "secondary_message": null
    },
    {
      "primary_message": "Cover containers and refrigerate until ready to eat. Enjoy!",
      "secondary_message": null
    }
  ],
